## CSS Variables

```tsx /bg-background/ /text-foreground/
<div className="bg-background text-foreground" />
```

To use CSS variables for theming set `tailwind.cssVariables` to `true` in your `duck-ui.config.json` file.

```json {12} title="duck-ui.config.json" showLineNumbers
